5380       ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
5381       
5382       data sample;
5383       call streaminit(314159);
5384       do id=1 to 120;
5385        x=rand('normal'); z=rand('normal'); w=rand('normal'); group=1+mod(id,3);
5386        y=2+1.5*x-0.6*z+0.4*group+rand('normal');
5387        role=mod(id,4); output;
5388       end;
5389       run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SAMPLE has 120 observations and 7 variables.

5390       
5391       proc hpquantselect data=sample;
5392       class group;
5393       model y=x z w group / quantile=0.25 0.75 clb;
5394       selection method=backward(select=sbc choose=sbc);
5395       performance nthreads=1;
5396       run;

NOTE: The HPQUANTSELECT procedure is executing in single-machine mode.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE HPQUANTSELECT printed pages 211-215.

